  "hypothesis": "A fused column-first streaming sweep with compact 32-bit row history should reduce memory traffic and retained data while keeping per-column state contiguous.",
  "notes": "History requires 4*N*min(S,N-S) bytes plus O(N) column state. Accumulation uses 64-bit arithmetic; thread settings and other files remain unchanged.",
